An Atmospheric Water Dispenser Donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen to Kantha Bopha Hospital
The handover ceremony was held at Kantha Bopha Hospital by Dr. Kisanti, Managing Director of Kantha Bopha Hospital, and was attended by relevant officials of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, as well as many doctors. Well.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol stated that the water purifier with an atmosphere, which was handed over now, is a precious gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to provide people to use in While bringing children to receive treatment at Kantha Bopha Hospital to reduce the carrying of pure water and to reduce the impact on the environment.
Dr. Kisanti, Managing Director of Kantha Bopha Hospital, said that this water machine is very important for the hospital, especially the people who bring their children to check and treat the hospital, about 4,000 people a day can use. This water purifier has high quality and reduces the cost of buying water from outside.
Please be informed that Natural Water Purifier - WATERGEN is a technology from Israel capable of automatically producing pure water from the air in the atmosphere of about 800 liters per day with high quality and safety and reduce exposure. Environment and to meet the need for clean drinking water in hospitals as well as humanitarian activities in various environments and areas lacking access to clean water.
