He added that the tax on capital gains is not a new tax. This tax has been in the budget law since 2010, but the Royal Government allows it to be extended until 2020. General knowledge: The important habits of billionaire Elon Musk that made him a successful person
* Morning routine:
However, there is one difference from the others that is admirable for Iceland Mas. He usually does not eat breakfast because he wants to start working as soon as possible. He also made time to take a shower, but then he started working.
During her time at work, Elan Mas had other small personal habits that always benefited her. He divides his daily work schedule into five sections, each with a specific goal in mind. This technique helps him focus and work better, even if it is only for a short time.
When it comes to eating, Elon Musk practices similar habits. He eats as fast as he can to get to work, and sometimes he holds it in his hand and walks around eating. For lunch, he often eats in moderation. But he always eats immediately, only 5 minutes if he is busy with business meetings.
* Post-work habits
We can only imagine that Elon Musk will take some time off after work. But after looking at his daily work schedule, he clearly shows us that this superman is busier than we thought.
Elan Musk thinks work is more important than anything, and he rarely goes to the gym, even though he sometimes completes his work. He is estimated to go to the gym at least twice a week.
Even when not working, Elan Mas keeps his brain busy. He likes to read books and often reads until he falls asleep. He goes to bed at 1am and wakes up at 7am, then resumes his daily routine.
* Weekend habits
Iceland Mass's weekends are not as exciting as their work days. For Saturday, he can continue to work at SpaceX for a full 40 hours a week at the company, as mentioned above. However, for this Saturday, he also took time to relax with his five children.
Sunday, for the most part, is's the holiday of Iceland Mass. He may spend time traveling to other places or he may not go anywhere.
