(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Cambodia, is proud that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Cambodia has been able to overcome difficulties and almost complete the demarcation of the land border between Cambodia - Vietnam.
