Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh Recommends 3 Points to the Joint Border Affairs Committee to Implement Its Work More Effectively
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh, Minister of National Defense, made three recommendations to the Joint Committee on Border Affairs of 35 relevant ministries and institutions to implement border work with neighboring countries more effectively.
The three recommendations of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh were made this morning, August 27, 2020, on the occasion that Samdech invited the representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, to present a 1-scale land border map. / 25,000 to 35 relevant ministries and institutions to be used at the Peace Palace.
