(Phnom Penh): Dr. Sok Po, President of the National Blood Transfusion Center, on August 27, 2020, stated that regular blood donation has many important benefits, such as removing nutrients from the body to help reduce Weight loss will be followed by fatigue and constant tiredness.
Dr. Sok Po confirmed this during his participation in the press conference on "Blood Donation to Save Lives" on the ground floor of the Freedom Hall of the Office of the Council of Ministers, organized by the Government Spokesperson Unit.
Dr. Sok Po stated: "Regular blood donation is not only not detrimental to health, it also has the benefit of removing nutrients from our body, and the obvious reason is to lose weight. "When you gain weight, you eat more and eat more, and if we donate some nutrients, we can lose weight."
Dr. Sok Po stated that when we reduce body fat through blood donation and exercise can help us reduce stress, which helps improve blood flow in the arteries. Good blood circulation can help us avoid stroke and improve heart health.
He said that according to a study by the British Public Health Organization also, regular blood donation can reduce the risk of cancer. Therefore, donating blood has many good points, which is a source of pride as a Cambodian child, we can help a lot of Cambodians in the hospital, they are all on the brink of death.
