According to the school of the Chinese-Khmer Association in Battambang province, Mr. Oknha Lim Taleng claimed that the land for the entrance to the Leang Hour Chinese School, which is a new location and to hold a groundbreaking ceremony at the end of this month, he bought from the people. For a long time, he also paved the road for the construction of a new Chinese school and built a fence on his land.
As for the people living along this road, they are protesting now because Tycoon Lim Taleng has built a fence and excavated the flat land into a canal, blocking their access.
After a verbal altercation, Mr. Pheng Sothy led the team to the scene and confirmed to the media that according to the land plan, it was confirmed long ago that it was farmland and a canal, but later Due to the development and progress so far, these lands have become urban lands and residential lands.
