Today, she is happy to dismantle these buildings voluntarily because the APSARA Authority has provided me with a new location for resale, which is new, cleaner and cleaner than the old place.
Ms. Seang Soth also supported the measures taken by the APSARA Authority to keep the area around the odd pond clean so that Angkor is tidy and green for more tourists to visit and shop more.
