(Prey Veng): Prey Veng Provincial Police issued a statement on the case of intentional violence caused by two groups of gangsters on August 18, 2020 at around 23:05 at Chheu Treng village, Reak Chey commune, Ba Phnom district. Prey Veng Province.
According to the research of the Prey Veng Provincial Police, the first group of 8 perpetrators used 4 motorbikes to live in Kraing village, Theay commune, Ba Phnom district, Prey Veng province. There are 6 members using 4 motorbikes living in Prey Veng and Phnom Penh.
In the case of violence by the two gangsters, using the baton, belt, samurai sword as weapons, launched an attack on each other, causing one minor injury, one serious injury and the death of a young man before being sent to the emergency room. Hospital in Phnom Penh, Yean Samnang, male, 20 years old, living in Kraing village, Theay commune, Ba Phnom district, Prey Veng province.
