According to the Ministry of Interior, the Royal Government's working group to coordinate the requests and requests of civil society organizations has held six meetings and consultations with representatives of civil society organizations to find out the purpose and reasons for Propose amendments to 17 articles of the Law on Associations and Non-Governmental Organizations.
