(Preah Sihanouk): A man jumped to his death in the sea at Ong Ream village, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province on August 20, 2020, and the authorities tried to save but did not succeed.
On the morning of August 25, 2020, the Sihanoukville Provincial Police Traffic Police Force, in cooperation with GTVC, using two GTVC O'Burbs, searched for the body of 31-year-old Chhim Chheng.
According to Major General Chuon Narin, after checking, the relatives of the relatives admitted that it was really their relatives' corpse.
Currently, the team is waiting for a wooden boat to receive the body back to the land for technical inspection and hand over the body to the family for burial.
