The Sihanoukville Provincial Police said that the shocking incident happened on the afternoon of August 22, 2020 at ABA Bank in Village 2, Sangkat 2, Sihanoukville. Immediately at the time of the incident, a Cambodian citizen reported to the provincial police commission, and the commission ordered the police force patrolling the area, and the patrol force immediately launched an operation.
