The meeting was also attended by the chairmen and representatives of young engineers from ASEAN countries as well as the ASEAN Young Engineers Secretariat.
The main purpose of this meeting is:
First, gather perspectives from member countries of the ASEAN Engineering Federation for discussion at the 38th Conference in Vietnam.
Second: Contribute to improving the engineering profession.
Third: Strengthen the professional capacity of all skills and expand human resources in accordance with current and future social needs.
Fourth, to ensure that the engineering profession has quality, efficiency, safety, stability and high responsibility.
Fifth, strengthen national and international cooperation and internal relations.
Sixth: Recognize the quality of engineering education and professional training to have the title of national and international professional engineers.
