Ministry of Health: Chinese man who died in Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province due to heart attack during sex, not due to Kovid-19 disease
Ms. O Vandin stated that the Ministry of Health would like to inform the public that a Chinese man died suddenly during sex, which happened in Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province on the 21st. This August 2020.
The Ministry would also like to confirm that the Chinese man who died above, a construction foreman in Phnom Penh, had been in love with the above woman for about a year, and this Chinese man always visited the women's district and Meet this woman one by one before the above death incident.
Ms. Vandin added, "Kampong Cham Provincial Health Department team took samples from the body of a Chinese man this morning, August 21, and sent it to the Institut Pasteur du Cambodge for examination, and the results confirmed that the body did not contain the Kovid virus." 19 No. "So the sudden death during sex is caused by high blood pressure, causing a heart attack."
