According to a meeting at the Pentagon, the United States does not seem to have focused on whether the UFOs were of extraterrestrial or alien origin, but the United States is skeptical that they could be any country's secret aircraft. The United States has been most skeptical of China because of its recent advances in drone technology.
One video was taken in 2004 near the coast of southern California, while the other two were filmed by a pilot on an F-18 along the Atlantic coast of the eastern United States. United States in 2015. For both videos in 2015, one pilot on a fighter jet expressed surprise at the speed of the UFO, while the other assumed it could be a drone.
The U.S. Navy first recognized the video, which was leaked in 2007 and 2017, in September 2019. Although it is acknowledged that the above three video clips are true, but the objects in the video still no one can confirm for sure.
