Castro trichomoniasis is one of the most common microorganisms in the marine environment. They are generally 3 millimeters in size and their natural life span is limited to three days.
Flying ants live only three weeks. They are male ants that live with other female ants in a group, meaning that as long as the ants have wings, they are identified as male or flying ants.
Flies are insects that we often see, especially in our homes, and they live only four weeks. This species eats all kinds of food, no matter how rotten or rotten, especially its legs can be infected with germs, which is why we need to be careful about it.
There are at least 5,000 different species of flies in our world. The maximum lifespan of this species is 4 months, but some flies can not live this long because they can be eaten by other animals such as spiders, birds, locusts and frogs. It should be noted that strong winds and bad weather make it difficult for them to hatch from worms.
The average life cycle of mice is one year, but harassment from external conditions such as cats and poisoning can kill them at any time. Despite being one year old, mice are classified as the shortest-lived animals.
Ship mice are considered endearing pets and are native to South Africa. Unfortunately, their life cycle is only four years. These animals are very susceptible to infection, so their care must be taken.
Giving a lot of food and food to domestic rats is also a cause of health problems. It is advisable to give them plenty of water to drink every day, as this species needs a lot of water. Please note that domestic rats are also many breeding species.
