Mr. Suon Serey Ratha: Only anarchist politicians are provoking the anger of the people to demand the release of suspects from the court (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Mr. Suon Serey Ratha, former President of the Khmer Rouge Party and Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development said. That only anarchist politicians use anarchic methods to provoke the anger of the people to come out and demand the release of suspects from the judiciary.
The senior official's reaction came after an illegal rebel group led by prisoner Sam Rainsy incited opposition activists to demand the release of Rong Chhun, who was detained by a court in connection with a border case.
Mr. Suon Serey Ratha added, "In a country where there are laws and reforms to strengthen the rule of law, it is not allowed for anarchic politicians to live outside the law and do whatever they want ... We respect the right of expression. "People just have to clean up the anarchist politicians who pretend to be angry and exploit the people for political gain in the forum of the people."
He added that "anarchic politicians who like to pretend to shout in the crowd of people who express their opinions and who like to use anarchic methods to destroy social order must be collected and put in place to take care of education." 53 Poor Families in Serei Sophorn Receive Donations from Provincial Governor
