(Svay Rieng): Mr. Sor Sodany, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng City, confirmed that Svay Rieng Municipality authorities will take legal action without any exceptions for any traders who continue to build, encroach on roads and use public roads as shopping areas. Lose the beauty of the city and confiscate materials and goods from the designated place to store, not responsible for any damage.
