(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, as well as their families and relatives, on Tuesday afternoon, August 11, 2020. Organized a 100-day nursing ceremony to dedicate the merits of the meritorious dean Vivathana Bun Seangly, who is a mother-in-law, mother-in-law and grandmother.
The Nursing Ceremony will be held at the residence of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen in Sangkat Chaktomuk, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh.
