Samdech Preah Sang Neay, Samdech Preah Sang Neay, Deputy Chief and Samdech Preah Reach Kanha, 12 people greeted 96 monks and nuns. In order to dedicate the great merit to the soul of Neak Oknha Prit Moha Upasika Dhammanhan Vivathana, who performed this deed of departure from this world to the next world.
It should be noted that Duke Prit Moha Upasika Thomman Vivathana Bunseangly passed away at 2:12 AM on the 13th day of the month of Pisak in the year 2563, which is the 4th day of May, 2020, at the age of 96 years old.
The death of Oknha Prit Moha Upasika Thommanhan Vivathana Bunseangly is the great loss of a Buddhist full of purity in the Dharma who donated his wealth and mental strength with the deepest generosity in humanitarian work and the promotion of Buddhism. .
At a young age, Duke Prit Maha Upasika Dhammanyan Vivathana, a Buddhist full of generosity, contributed to the construction of many achievements for the benefit of Buddhism. In addition to being a great supporter of Buddhism, Duke Prit Moha Upasika Dhammhanavivathana has also participated in many humanitarian activities in society. Summary of important news events for August 12, 2020
