(Kampong Chhnang): During a meeting between Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police Commissioner and a group of provincial journalists, Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Khov Ly said that between journalists and the police force, they must work closely and help society. Nation because these two units are also the staff of the Royal Government as well.
