(Phnom Penh): This morning, August 11, 2020, the Ministry of Tourism organized a ceremony to disseminate the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and other guidelines in response to the context of Kovid-19 in the field of tourism, accompanied by training courses on " Strengthen social morals, values, women and the Khmer family.
