Out of jealousy, a man used a bamboo stick to beat his wife to death in Romduol district, Svay Rieng province
(Svay Rieng): A jealous man drank alcohol and became jealous and beat his wife to death with a bamboo stick when she was taken to the hospital. This case happened at 18:30 on August 9, 2020 in Leak Reachea village, Kampong Chak commune, Romduol district, Svay Rieng province.
According to the Romduol district police, there was a case of intentional violence with aggravating circumstances, resulting in the death of the victim, caused by the suspect, Pareth, 38 years old, a husband living in the commune. Mao Nen, a 31-year-old woman, was beaten to death by a half-meter-long bamboo stick while being taken to hospital after the operation.
The same authority confirmed that the reason why the husband beat his wife to death was because he was drunk and jealous of his wife, so he used a bamboo stick to beat his wife.
The suspect has now fled the scene while authorities search for him and bring him to justice.
