The conference was held under the theme "Building and Building Our Nation in the Post-Crisis-19 World: Interdependence, Mutual Prosperity and Global Values." Key world leaders, including heads of state, heads of government, heads of government, as well as religious and civil society leaders from more than 160 countries, were invited to attend via video.
