(Svay Rieng): There was a case of surprise in the morning to the villagers and reported to the local authorities after a woman riding a Honda C125 Series 2020 came to a stop at her mother's house to sell and did not unlock the door when the suspect came to see her Also do the action, drive away.
This incident happened at 8 am on August 9, 2020 in Preah Tonle village, Sangkhor commune, Svay Rieng city.
