The video conference brings together leaders from heads of state, heads of government and heads of civil society organizations from more than 160 countries around the world.
In front of the world's major leaders, Samdech Techo Hun Sen focused on working together to fight the 19 plague epidemic that is causing and causing problems in the world.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on world leaders to consider the Kovid 19 vaccine as a common commodity of humanity and to stop blaming each other by turning to tackling and fighting this global epidemic.
