She also called on people to protect themselves from being bitten by tiger mosquitoes and to jointly eliminate tiger and tiger mosquito breeding grounds by putting albatross in water bottles and removing water sources around their homes.
It should also be noted that Vital is a Cambodian company that has been operating for 10 years and has received strong support from the Cambodian people. Through the 25 Riel Fund, Vital has been actively involved in social activities, focusing on four major areas: culture and religion, sports and health, environment and education.
