Man's body found floating in Pursat river after missing for 3 days
(Pursat): The body of a man was found floating in the water of Pursat River and reported to the authorities to intervene.
This incident caused a surprise at 2:30 pm on August 7, 2020 under the steel bridge in Po Ta Kuy village, Sangkat Lolok Sor, Pursat city, Pursat province.
Pursat City Police said that the body of the victim who was found floating in the Pursat River was named Un Vuthy, male, 58 years old, Cambodian, working at home, living in the above mentioned commune.
According to local sources, on August 5, 2020, prior to the incident, the victim, Un Vuthy, was drunk and walked on the steel bridge and jumped into the water. . Suddenly, his nieces and nephews searched everywhere but could not find him until August 7, 2020, when they found the body floating under the steel bridge at the scene and reported to the authorities to intervene. Pull the corpse onto the river bank.
At present, the bodies of the victims have been received by their families for the traditional rites.
