Interview with Mr. Huy Vannak about the achievements of the SOC for 4 years
Mr. Huy Vannak: I would like to thank you! I can conclude that in the last four years, two terms, we in the CUP have come together as one to achieve three historic achievements, both hardware and software, that I mean. To build our ideal ideological conscience with a clear cause, contribute to strengthening the capacity of information and dissemination for the cause of national excellence.
Second, we have built an institution that is representative both nationally and internationally. The CJCC is currently chairing the ICAPP International Press Forum, which has 50 member countries. In the national forum, we play the role of monitoring the broadcast and acting as the voice of national defense. At the same time, we contribute to the training and orientation of the campaign to protect the values of the people and the superiority of our motherland Cambodia.
One important point I would like to highlight is "culture of sharing and helping each other in difficult times." I would like to mention the mutual support that the federation has continuously provided to our journalists who are in need when they are sick and to help the bereaved families who can celebrate traditionally and even afford to buy houses for their orphaned children. Also.
