At the same time, the First Deputy Secretary-General conveyed the message of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to all citizens to be vigilant about Kovid-19, a rapidly spreading disease that the world has not yet Vaccines and treatments are still available.
In addition, the whole world has been looking for ways to prevent the Kovid-19 virus. For Cambodia, we have put in place immediate and clear measures to prevent the spread of the disease in the community, to achieve effective treatment without death and subsequent cure.
At the same time, people should continue to pay attention to the implementation of the measures of the Ministry of Health and should increase awareness of the importance of doing good deeds for immigrants, maintaining social distance, maintaining hygiene, eating clean and exercising. Regularly, especially avoid self-medication or medication that can be life-threatening.
