They have set up a "ghost" commission to clear the border while the government is busy resolving the Kovid 19 issue. Most of the border instigators were refugees, but Rong Chhun was used by the group as a pawn to provoke local unrest, acting as a border troublemaker to divert attention. Khmer people should forget the story of Kovid-19, which the government of Samdech Techo Hun Sen managed well and successfully.
In addition, the group's goal is to seize the opportunity that Vietnam is in conflict with China to create problems with Vietnam, straining Cambodian-Vietnamese relations leading to border disputes. All this is in the scenario of foreigners who pave the way for extremists to walk.
In the past, in order to achieve the goals that foreign bosses want, Rong Chhun has set up a number of civil society organizations, such as the Watchtower Council, including unions, and a working group to spread false information about the border. And those civil society organizations are all illegal organizations because they have never been registered with the Ministry of Labor or the Ministry of Interior.
