Sam Rainsy criticizes the government for allowing the reopening of entertainment clubs In fact, Sam Rainsy wants to continue to close to keep workers in the service and entertainment sector unemployed. On the contrary, Sam Rainsy criticized the government for refusing to open schools, which in fact Sam Rainsy wanted to open so that students could be infected with Kovid-19 and the disease could spread to the community.
