National Committee for Sub-National Democratic Development and Kampong Chhnang Provincial Authority Hold a Meeting to Support the Implementation of LASED-II
(Kampong Chhnang): This morning, August 05, 2020, at the meeting hall of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Hall, a meeting was held to support the implementation of projects at the sub-national level of the Land Allocation Project for Social Affairs and Economic Development Phase 2 (LASED-II). Of the Secretariat of the National Committee for Sub-National Democratic Development (NCDD).
The main objectives of this mission include:
* To monitor and promote the implementation of the project action plan and budget in each target province to ensure both efficiency and effectiveness by exploring options and methods to accelerate the implementation process.
