(Kampong Thom): There was a traffic accident when three vehicles collided with each other, causing one person to die after being sent to Kampong Thom Provincial Hospital and another person was seriously injured.
This incident happened at 4:30 in the morning on August 6, 2020 on National Road No. 6 between km 197.198, Kbal village, Sankor commune, Kampong Svay district, Kampong Thom province.
The cause was caused by a Mark Fuso car driving from east to west, breaking the steering wheel and hitting a Hyundai car traveling from west to east, causing the Fuso car to overturn in the middle of the south side of the road, then a Samsung truck carrying pork. On the way from west to east, the fuselage (V1) overturned on the north side of the road.
Exhibits were taken by professional forces and kept at the Police Inspectorate of Kampong Svay District to wait for legal procedures.
Fire burns furniture factory in Shandong Bavet Special Economic Zone but does not cause any casualties
(Svay Rieng): A fire at a furniture factory (Master Black Smith Metal) in the Shandong Special Economic Zone caused a fire in the accommodation of (Chinese) workers made of 100 x 05 meters of galvanized iron, completely suspected to be caused by The electric shock caused damage to a large number of materials but did not cause any injuries.
