Pa Socheatvong, president of the Phnom Penh Municipal Council, said that the problem of gas or the sale of bottled gasoline on the streets or grocery stores is a safety challenge, need to pay more attention to eliminate the fire. Occurred in Phnom Penh in the past, mostly caused by the explosion of gas cans without technology. National Road No. 10 connecting Battambang, Pursat and Koh Kong Provinces Completed More Than 36%
