On August 4, 2020, Mr. Ma Sun Huot, Under Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, led a working group of the Project Management Unit (PMU) and the Project Implementation Unit (PIU) to inspect the progress of the construction of National Road No. 10. Attended by representatives of China Road Bridge Corporation (CRBC), technical officers under the Ministry and stakeholders.
