The Deputy Governor also encouraged fish farms, chicken farmers and vegetable farmers to continue their efforts to expand and develop their work to increase the economy, supply the local market, reduce imports from neighboring countries. Agricultural officials at all levels have a very important role to play, they must work with farmers to provide techniques and solutions when they face problems.
