(Phnom Penh) - Ouk Vichet, the father of Sunway, a boy who used to show on TV the great memories of the 45 American presidents and the history of the US president, wrote on August 6, 2020 A letter from the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, asking for intervention to help Sunway return to his home.
According to Ouk Vichet's letter, he and his son are suffering from a family crisis due to a divorce from his wife, who lost his home because his wife returned the house to his relatives.
Samdech Puk is highly respected
On October 25, 2019, I received a divorce complaint from the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. My wife took her two children out of the house, a 7-year-old son named Vichet Kantha Panhasit, nicknamed Sunway, and a 2-year-old son named Vichet Kantha Sithileap. A week later, because Sunway was crying and wanted to come back with me, he let me go.
On January 3, 2020, I applied for a protection order for the house we are living in, which is named after my wife, but it was bought in 2016 during our marriage. I am both.
On January 30, 2020, I applied for another protection order to the court to request the right to return home.
On April 6, 2020, I filed a complaint at the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal. The Phnom Penh Court of Appeal opened its hearing on July 29, 2020, and the verdict will be announced on August 6, 2020. And according to the news, there will be the same story behind the intervention that is happening at the Court of Appeal in Phnom Penh, just like at the trial court.
My son and I have been asking to stay with you for over six months, and every day, Sunway seeks to visit his house, but because I told him that his house is being repaired. I do not dare to tell you the truth for fear that if you can not go home, the child is smart, has a perfect memory, may affect the development of both his intellect and spirit.
As mentioned above, I ask Samdech Puk Met to review the whole story and intervene for the perpetrators behind this story to stop their activities so that the judge can make a decision with pure discretion so that I and my son can get it. Real justice.
Please, please, please, please, please, please, please, please, please, please, please
Please, Samdech Puk Met, receive the highest respect from me.
