(Svay Rieng): There was a surprise in the early morning when a buffalo herdsman found a dead body floating in a canal and reported to the local authorities immediately to check for fear of murder.
This incident happened at 8 am on August 5, 2020 behind the brick kiln in Thnal Keng village, Popet commune, Svay Teap district, Svay Rieng province.
According to the district police, the man was named Chey Sokhen, 50 years old, a truck driver, residing in Doeum Po village, Svay Ta Yean commune, Kampong Rou district, Svay Rieng province.
According to villagers, before the incident, a man was seen diving into the canal, but everyone was not interested. Report to the authorities immediately.
According to the autopsy of the district police and the district doctor, the victim really died by slipping and falling into the canal water, there are no signs of murder.
After examining the body, the competent police handed it over to the family for the traditional ceremony.
