According to project officials, the Ta Chik canal in Ta Eng village is part of the Asian Development Bank's (ADB) city rehabilitation project, but the project has not yet been completed. The provincial governor will meet with a representative of the Asian Development Bank. To discuss in restoring this canal first to release water from Kampot city as soon as possible.
Regarding the canal in Trapeang Thom village, Trapeang Thom commune, Teuk Chhou district, there was landslide and houses were built on the canal, which made it difficult to restore the canal. To solve this problem, the provincial governor provided 500 meters of drainage. To connect to Prek Chik in Ta Eng village, Sangkat Kampong Kandal, Kampot city.
