(Prey Veng): Mr. Khieu Phearith, Member of Parliament for Prey Veng Province and Chairman of the Committee of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Prey Veng Province, this morning, August 1, 2020, led a campaign to plant about 500 trees at Wat Sam Samey, Prey Veng City, Prey Veng Province. The song "Youth for the Sea of Wood".
