(Phnom Penh): A drug dealer was arrested by the Trapeang Krasang Police Force while patrolling to prevent crime and conduct research for the past two months, until now he has received clear information from the people and the force went to work Arrest this target only once.
The crackdown and arrest took place on the evening of July 30, 2020 in Samaki 4 Village, Sangkat Trapeang Krasaing, Khan Por Sen Chey. The above suspect, San Raya, alias Ya, 28 years old, a worker living in the village, confiscated 8 small packages of drugs.
Lt. Neang Udom, police chief of Trapeang Krasang police station, said that the suspect was one of the most active drug traffickers in the area and had been involved in illegal activities for a long time. As for his forces, they have been suspicious for a long time and have been monitoring them all the time, but there is no chance of repression at all, just for the past two months.
The police chief said that until July 30, his police force patrolled to hide the crime and search and received information that the suspect was involved in drug trafficking. He went down to crack down and arrested immediately and confiscated the remaining eight small packages from the person who sold them, then took them to the police station for questioning to build a case for legal action. Cracking down on a cockfighting venue in Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province
(Kampong Cham): A gambling place in Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province was cracked down on by the Kampong Cham Provincial Police. The operation took place on the afternoon of July 30, 2020, following an order from Kampong Cham Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Em Kosal.
According to the report of the Provincial Police Commissioner, after receiving information from the people, the General Commissioner ordered the Chamkar Leu District Police Inspectorate to crack down on illegal gambling sites (cockfighting, betting) at the cashew plantation on the border with the province. Kampong Cham and Kampong Thom Province are located in Popreng Village, Speu Commune, Chamkar Leu District.
As a result, during the crackdown, the gamblers escaped, leaving behind a number of exhibits, including five motorcycles, two roosters, one chicken basket, and some scotch tape. Currently, the above exhibits are kept at the Chamkar Leu District Police Inspectorate to build a case according to the procedure.
Vacation home in Dara Chan Beach Vacation City Project, under $ 60,000!
(Koh Kong): Koh Kong Province is a coastal mountainous area in the southwestern part of the country and is one of the four coastal provinces of Cambodia.
This beautiful land is rich in natural resources, biodiversity and 215 km long coastline, and is the second largest mangrove forest in the world.
Koh Kong also has a favorable geographical location, bordering the Gulf of Thailand, the border with Thailand and the provinces in the southwest, especially Sihanoukville, which is the largest commercial area after Phnom Penh.
All these features make Koh Kong one of the most attractive development destinations for local and foreign investors.
Among the many new projects that are expected to emerge in the coming years, the most prominent is Dara Chan Beach.
Dara Chan Beach is a cultural and ecological paradise along the coast, located in Botum Sakor District, Koh Kong Province.
Dara Chan Beach is part of the development project of the giant resort city of Darasakor, which covers an area of 360 square kilometers and a beautiful beach of 90 kilometers.
Dara Chan Beach Project is a mixed development project with a total development area of about 4.5 million square meters, covering an area of 20 square kilometers. The vacation city project includes private residences, five-star hotels and coastal ecological resorts that bring a new and unique experience of exploring the underwater world and beautiful ecological parks.
In addition, Dara Chan Beach project includes international standard commercial buildings with shopping malls, entertainment centers, shops, restaurants, cafes, bars, cinemas, event halls, health centers and educational centers.
In addition, the project is located near Darasakor International Standard Airport and Darasakor Beach Golf Course.
Dara Chan Beach Project has officially started the first phase of development project and is expected to be completed by 2021.
In the first phase, the developer focuses on the construction of 170,000 square meters of private housing.
This project offers a choice of 6 types of villas and bungalows from 1 bedroom to 3 bedrooms and sizes from 35 square meters to 302 square meters.
As for the interior design, the architects combine the traditional Khmer style with the resort-style architecture, which not only brings freshness and relaxation, but also creates an atmosphere of intimacy, sweetness and romance.
Each house has a beautiful bedroom, a living room and a porch in front of the house that allows residents to relax and enjoy the fresh air from the beach as well as sit and watch the sunset over the beautiful ocean with a couple under the atmosphere. Romantic.
Housing in the Dara Chan Beach project starts at just $ 56,320. For those who buy a house today will get many benefits such as:
1: Become a permanent member of Darasakor Vacation Resort
2: Lease option back to the project owner
3: Option to sell back to the project owner at the original price (5 years after the official handover).
