(Stung Treng): Mr. Mam Saroeun, Governor of Stung Treng Province, on July 30, 2020, chaired a meeting to review the progress of the provincial administration in July 2020 and to propose further work for the purpose of monitoring and strengthening the work. Efficiency in carrying out the work of provincial administrations and departments to be more efficient.
