On July 15, 2020, Yim Vuthy decided to file a complaint with the Criminal Police Department for research and procedures. After receiving the complaint, the Criminal Police Department prepared a case file for legal proceedings and requested a preliminary investigation from a representative of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
The Criminal Police Department hopes that the public, journalists and social media users will be informed and please do not jump to conclusions without a clear evidence and investigation.
