This challenge provides the school with an opportunity to demonstrate the strength of its curriculum as well as its existing educational framework through the effectiveness of distance learning practices.
Through the success and positive feedback provided by parents, guardians and students, the school has decided to continue to provide its distance education services to further demonstrate that CIA First International School is an accredited educational institution. Internationally.
CIA First International School stated, "We have always wanted to create a degree for distance learning at CIA First International School, so we are pleased to continue to work on this project under the circumstances." "It's favorable for students as well as educators around the world to seem to recognize and embrace the benefits of distance learning."
As a member of QM Education Quality Assurance, CIA First International School has now become part of a community of more than 1,200 members focused on the quality of student learning. The school community has been looking forward to cooperation and mutual learning as the school community continues to take positive steps in providing distance education experiences in Cambodia as well as around the world. .
