(Phnom Penh): A surprise happened after the fishermen found the body of a man floating in the middle of the river.
The incident took place at 11:20 a.m. on July 29, 2020, along the Tonle Sap River in Chroy Changvar commune, Chroy Changvar district, Phnom Penh. The body of the above man named Prak Wutty, 24 years old, lived in a rented house around Boeung Salang, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
Sources from the victim's sister said that because the victim had a crisis in business and love, the victim had considered suicide three times, but did not succeed because of relatives. Will see friends to help stop immediately. For the fourth time, the victim took his cell phone and handed it to his sister, who told him to go out for a while but could not return home.
On the morning of July 29, 2020, he was informed that the body of a man was found floating in the Tonle Sap River, he and his friends immediately traveled to the scene. When he arrived at the above location, he also examined the body of the man who was really his brother.
