Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that for the people who are living to enjoy the actual benefits in the state land as mentioned above, it is strictly forbidden to cut down and expand the land, it is absolutely not allowed.
Samdech added that the distribution of land to the people, the relevant ministries and authorities must be thoroughly and correctly prohibited from taking advantage of the distribution of land to the people will be punished.
In addition to clearing land for the people according to their actual living space, the state will provide 10% of the land for the common benefit of the community to use as a forest for firewood and as a shelter for cattle grazing. This is the additional confirmation of Samdech Techo Prime Minister.
Regarding the encroachment on state land, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also said that in the past, Samdech had observed that only the powerful and the rich used small people to encroach on their land. As for the group of criminals who invaded the state land in one night to build 10 to 20 huts, Samdech already knew and identified and targeted.
