The evacuation will take at least four days with local airlines operating about 100 daily flights from Da Nang to 11 cities in Vietnam, the Hanoi government said in a statement. As of Tuesday, Vietnam had identified 11 new cases of COVID-19, bringing the total to 431 cases, of which 365 had been cured and no deaths had been reported.
Dr. Sok Touch: "If a nation does not have its own history, it is the worst"
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, stressed that if a nation does not have its own history, that nation is one of the worst nations.
Dr. Sok Touch's statement came as some Cambodian historians disagreed over the history of Cambodia, as well as the separation of traces of history that occurred in Cambodia in the past and present. .
Therefore, in order to clarify the history of Cambodia to be sure between the group of historians, on the morning of July 28, 2020, the Royal Academy of Cambodia held the 4th meeting of the group of historians on "Discussion for ideas for group compilation. Cambodian Historians ”with the participation of a large group of historians and historians at the Royal Academy of Cambodia.
Dr. Sok Touch emphasized, "If a nation does not have its own history, that nation is the worst nation. We will let politicians recognize history after research, because I understand that historians are very afraid of politicians and you "Politics is also afraid of historians."
In this meeting, Dr. Sok Touch also allowed all the professors of history to discuss the views and perceptions of the history of Cambodia to discuss to find a clear element of history for the next generation of young Cambodians. Study, learn and so on.
Dr. Sok Touch said that Cambodia must have a clear history and the consensus of the historical experts to make this history for the younger generation to learn, especially for politicians to understand more. Clear from the national history of Cambodia as well.
In addition, Dr. Sok Touch stated that the fact that politicians do not understand the truth about history will make the country trample on traces of history. He also called on all historical experts to find out the true value of what has happened in the past so that everyone can understand correctly. Samneang Music Association for the Disabled Celebrates Ms. Nhem Morakot Appointed as Personal Advisor
According to the royal proclamation of Samdech Bour Kry, Ms. Nhem Morakot was named "Bot Nani Maha Upasika Buddhism".
During the celebration, which was held on the evening of July 27, 2020, Ms. Nhem Morakot expressed her great joy and thanked Samdech Bourkri for bestowing on her as a personal advisor.
She considers that this is a great honor that she has received and encourages her to work harder to promote people with disabilities to promote the right to life for the vulnerable, such as the Samneang Music Association for the Disabled with the Royal Government. Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Mr. Chap To said that the dedication of Ms. Nhem Morakot, Personal Adviser to Samdech Bour Kry, was very appropriate for her because she had sacrificed a lot of physical and mental energy to promote Buddhism as well as to celebrate with people with disabilities. Years ago.
