(Kampong Thom): In the morning of July 27, 2020, Mr. Kieng Sengky, President of the Local Council Association of Kampong Thom Province, urged the council to appoint the branch leaders of the local councils in Stong district, Kampong Thom province. There must be good internal unity so that the work can grow.
The purpose of establishing this branch is to have the role and duty to coordinate various tasks for commune / sangkat councils and to find challenges so that all council associations have the right to express their opinions in requesting to the higher level to help solve and A place to gather information to help develop the capacity of council members.
Mr. Kieng Sengky said that all Commune / Sangkat Councils must be united in their work and must make efforts to study and understand the law on legal documents so that when there is a problem, they do not answer each other. Without any responsibility and must participate in all activities of the association to participate in capacity development by changing bad behavior to respond in a timely manner according to the needs of the people.
