This year, the world is facing the Kovid-19 crisis, Cambodia is also affected, but Cambodia can still ensure food security and exports, especially agricultural products significantly.
Please be informed that under the great care of Mr. HUN Many in contributing to the development of this province in all fields, many achievements have appeared in the form of libraries, parks, gyms, stadiums, hospitals, schools. Learn pagodas, etc.
