Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends Condolences to Ouk Chan's Family
(Phnom Penh): The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has expressed his deepest condolences and sadness over the death of Mr. Ouk Chan, his personal adviser.
In his condolence message to his family on July 26, 2020, Samdech Techo considered the death of Mr. Ouk Chan as the loss of his pious grandfather and the loss of his children. An outstanding Khmer who is full of conscientious will to serve the cause of the nation, religion and the King in all circumstances responsibly.
It should be noted that Mr. Ouk Chan, personal advisor to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, passed away this morning, July 26, 2020, at the age of 80. Indravitcha University: Two More Candidates Become Official Doctors of Law
On the afternoon of July 26, 2020, Indra Vichea University organized a ceremony to defend the doctoral dissertation for the two candidates, which was also witnessed by representatives of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports and many distinguished guests. Also. Soeng Samnang scored "excellent" while Muon Sokna scored "very good".
* Dr. Soeng Samnang Candidate Thesis Defense Ceremony:
Candidate Dr. Soeng Samnang, majoring in Public Law, 3rd Generation, Part 2, defended his dissertation on the topic of the evolution of the Khmer Constitution and had two instructors, Dr. Khlot Thida and Dr. Lach Samrong.
* Doctor Muon Sona Candidate Thesis Defense Ceremony:
Candidate Dr. Muon Sona, 3rd Generation Legal Specialist, Part 2, defended his dissertation on the subject of inspection authority in the Kingdom of Cambodia and had two instructors, Dr. Khlot Thida and Dr. Som Somony.
After the presentation of the PhD candidate, the committee evaluated and asked questions, and the PhD candidate answered enthusiastically. As a result, the evaluation committee gave a “very good” score and approved Dr. Muon Sona as a candidate for the doctoral dissertation defense ceremony by editing the spelling, content and sentences to prepare for the publication of the scientific dissertation for submission. Public at educational institutions.
