Lt. Gen. Rath Sreang: Daun Penh Military Base Administration Building is 90% Completed
(Phnom Penh): Lt. Gen. Rath Sreang, Deputy Commander of the National Gendarmerie and Commander of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie, on the afternoon of July 26, 2020, continued to inspect the construction work of Daun Penh District Military Administration Building. Once again, to encourage the team to work hard to build as soon as possible in accordance with the definition and quality in accordance with technical standards.
As a result of regular inspections and work, the luxury administration building of the Daun Penh Military Police Base has appeared 90% complete. The building will be completed and put into operation in the near future.
Please note that Daun Penh Military Base Building is another new achievement after the 7th of January Military Base Building, which has already held its official opening ceremony under the presidency of Lt. Gen. Rath Sreang.
Both buildings are luxurious and will serve as a model for other military bases for future construction.
