According to the report of the intervention department and the explanation of the two officers with the disciplinary team of the office confirmed that the posting on the Facebook account alleged that on July 20, 2020 at 3 pm, there is a contracted officer Heng Meng Hun, who was standing at the Chaom Chao roundabout, called his car to check the traffic rules and extorted $ 40 and 30,000 riel from the car owner, which was not true information.
In this case, an unknown person may steal the action when he sees the contracted officer holding money in his hand with bad intentions to slander and defame the authorities.
