Minister of Justice introduces 5 points to all courts and prosecutors to improve the quality of fair and just trial (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): This afternoon, July 24, 2020, at the Ministry of Justice, a transfer ceremony was held. And to the position of Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court under the chairmanship of Mr. Keut Rith, Minister of Justice.
