Mr. Ouk Samnang also said that the distribution of rice seeds can not meet the needs of farmers, but it is a contribution to increase food production that farmers have experienced a shortage of rice seeds. It also urges farmers to increase rice production to meet household needs and market demand.
He also urged people to raise livestock such as chickens, ducks, fish, frogs, pigs, etc. at home to increase income in addition to farming and reduce imports.
