The ceremony was held in the presence of Mrs. Pheung Sakona, Minister of Culture and Fine Arts and Mr. Uy Ry, Chairman of the Provincial Council, Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Provincial Governor, and was attended by members of the Provincial Council, Provincial Board of Governors, Departments of State Units around the province. Municipalities, districts, civil servants, nearly 200 people participated.
