Please be reminded that on the morning of July 20, 2020, the competent authorities of the Criminal Police Department of the Ministry of Interior sent 11 suspects to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court for processing. The Chinese group arrested the victim, who was also a Chinese national, and took him to house 322, Street 956 in the upper commune village to kidnap him, but the police cracked down.
