Mr. Sun Pisey said, "The closing of this announcement was also attended by representatives of landowners. In the past, the authorities have also issued this notice several times, because before there was not much construction like this, but they refused to implement.
If the deadline for this notice is reached and you still do not dismantle it yourself, the Stung Hav District Administration will lead the District Unity Command to dismantle those huts without taking responsibility for any material damage. For those who refuse to comply with this notice, the district administration will take legal action.
Mr. Chai Jingheang, the owner of the land, said that he bought the land from the court auction because the original owner owed money to the bank and the court announced the auction, then many companies participated in the auction. To 4-5 times.
Later, Mr. Chai Jing Heang was the successful bidder. This means that this land is a land with a clear owner, a title deed and can only be mortgaged to the bank, and when the bidding was successful, all professional authorities cut the name from the original owner to Chai Jing Heang, which was bought from the court. Bid in accordance with legal procedures.
