Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara Chairs Inter-Ministerial Meeting on Land Issues in Mondulkiri Province
(Mondulkiri): Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, on July 22, 2020, chaired an inter-ministerial meeting on state land registration, private land registration of people, land registration of ethnic communities. Indigenous peoples, land dispute resolution, land clearing and land use planning in Mondulkiri province.
The meeting was attended by Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment, as well as provincial authorities and relevant officials.
