Samdech Techo Hun Sen stressed that those who commit these acts, if found guilty, will be arrested. Svay Rieng Provincial Authority Continues to Remind Citizens to Follow Ministry of Health Guidelines to Prevent Kovid-19 Transmission
(Svay Rieng): Mr. Toch Poliva, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, continues to remind all citizens to respect and strictly implement the principles of maintaining the social gap and the measures set by the Ministry of Health and to continue to be very careful in preventing and Prevent the spread of Kovid-19 virus in the second wave as the world faces a serious pandemic.
Mr. Toch Poliva made this remark on the occasion that he invited Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng Province, this morning, July 22, 2020, at the opening ceremony of the seminar on the presentation of research results on " "Implement tobacco control laws and how to prevent Kovid-19."
