Mr. Sok Lou sent a message from Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, who always cares about the well-being of all people, regardless of caste, color, religion or political affiliation.
He expressed his condolences over the damage to homes and property, a natural disaster no one wants to see. He urged all citizens to be very careful about their personal and family safety, as this season there is rain mixed with wind and thunder, which can be dangerous.
"If you have any problems, report them to the local authorities that are close to you so that the team can help you as soon as possible," he said.
