Chairman of Kampong Speu Provincial Council and Governor inspected the construction of Ta Hor Toul Thnong Bridge and urged professional officers to inspect the quality of the bridge
(Kampong Speu): On the morning of July 22, 2020, Mr. Yim Sokhom, Chairman of Provincial Council, Mr. Vy Samnang, Governor of Kampong Speu Province, led Mr. and Mrs. Director of Departments around Chbar Morn Municipality, Sangkat Chief and people to inspect the concrete. Tahor Toul Thnong Bridge is located in Toul Thnong Village, Sangkat Rokar Thom, Chbar Morn City, Kampong Speu Province.
