O Andong 1 Village Road, which used to be flooded during the rainy season, will no longer be flooded
(Phnom Penh): A road in O Andong 1 village, which is always flooded during the rainy season, will no longer be flooded from today onwards, with the attention of Mr. Cheng Monira, Chbar Ampov District Governor Raise to be a concrete road.
In fact, on the morning of July 22, 2020, the Chbar Ampov District Administration, with the participation of philanthropists, opened the construction site of this concrete road in the presence of Mr. Cheng Monira, District Governor, Mr. and Mrs. Deputy Governor, Chief of Administration, Sangkat Chief Many citizens.
Mr. Nhean Chansophea, Administrative Director of Chbar Ampov District Hall, said that the concrete road that opened the construction site today has a total length of 600 meters and a width of 10 meters in O Andong 1 Village, Sangkat Prek Pra, Chbar Ampov District.
In this ceremony, Mr. Cheng Monira had a talk and instructed the people by requesting the people living on both sides of the concrete road to cooperate to monitor the implementation of the project and understand the team that is repairing the concrete road.
The construction contractors must be quality for the benefit of the people for long-term use, and the district administration is praised by the people.
At the same time, the district governor requested the people to cooperate with the district authorities in providing various information related to local irregularities, especially before the non-criminal signs that cause social insecurity.
He said that all information provided by the authorities will be kept confidential and also means that you have joined the authorities in implementing the policy (safe villages and communes) effectively. We must work together to maintain peace and social stability in order to promote the nation's further development.
In front of the people, Mr. Cheng Monira said that under the funding of the Royal Government of Cambodia through Phnom Penh Capital Hall, every year, the district administration has continuously developed the local infrastructure according to the priority needs, including the official construction and repair. Prepare drainage system, public lighting and so on.
In addition to the Royal Government's funds, the district administration also strives to mobilize local people to participate in building a series of achievements to serve the public interest in responding to the needs of local people more effectively.
At the same time, the Chbar Ampov district administration has made great efforts to provide public services through the OWSO in accordance with the principles of effective, fast and transparent in accordance with the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia. "Make it faster and more transparent" to the people.
At the end of the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of the concrete road, the district governor called on the local people in Chbar Ampov district to report to the village and commune authorities about any relatives or neighbors who have just returned from abroad to introduce them. Prevent COVID-19 for the benefit of our community. EDC suspends electricity supply in some areas in Phnom Penh from July 23-26, facilitating road widening work
