Chronic dispute over 1 meter of public road in Kampot city has been resolved
(Kampot): A long-standing dispute over a 1-meter public road in Kampot City, Kampot Province, was resolved by the authorities by the Kampot Municipal Administration and the Provincial Department of Land Management, Urban Planning and Reparation on July 20, 2020. .
