President of the Cambodian Buddhist Cultural Center denies allegations of demolition of slums in Kirirom National Park
(Kampong Speu): Local authorities, including park rangers of the Ministry of Environment, on July 19, 2020, cooperated in dismantling the illegally constructed slums of a small number of people (about 4 families) who encroached on the land. Preah Suramarit Kosomak Kirirom National Park Resort in O Ses Village, Chambok Commune, Phnom Sruoch District, Kampong Speu Province.
But after the demolition of the slums, suddenly the people known as the owners of the small huts and the authorities came out and accused the authorities that led to the demolition of all the slums are the authorities, including park officials. Follow the orders of Mr. Nhek Buntha, President of the Cambodian Buddhist Cultural Center, which is completely untrue and will damage his honor and dignity.
The president of the Cambodian Buddhist Cultural Center confirmed that he was not involved or did not have the right to order the authorities to dismantle people's huts illegally built on national park land. However, the demolition was the only duty of the authorities as well as park rangers to protect the land from the Suramarit Kosomak Kirirom National Park from encroachment.
He added that the Cambodian Buddhist Cultural Center was established in accordance with Sub-Decree No. 215, which covers an area of 126 hectares in Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province, for the purpose of studying and understanding Buddhism in Cambodia. .
He said that the families came to build small huts that encroach on the land of the center, as well as encroach on the land of Suramarit Kosum Kirirom National Park. Therefore, both the authorities and the rangers of the Ministry of Environment have a duty to protect the national park area in that area, not the devotee who ordered the demolition.
He stated that he was an explanation of the Dharma, a monk, a learner, a devotee of merit and an educator in the field of Buddhism, and never caused any conflict with anyone, and only devoted to happiness. Therefore, the accusation against the Center as well as the accusation against the Duke of Maha Upasika is not correct and I would like to declare completely reject all the false accusations.
