Based on the private sector from the Royal Government as an investment capital to strengthen and expand the production base of mills and exporters, and on the basis of the adaptation of market changes in the last five years, Cambodia Achieve strong success in the field of rice for export to international markets from 2020 onwards, although the situation of the Kovid 19 epidemic continues.
The Rice Federation believes that the Royal Government of Cambodia will achieve 1 million tons of rice exports and that there will be sustainable growth and growth of all stakeholders in the near future.
