(Kampot): Mr. Chiao Tay, Governor of Kampot Province, reminded the relevant authorities to cooperate and fulfill their duties with high responsibility where there are problems and difficulties related to the people must go down to solve that place.
Reminds this as the Provincial Governor led the meeting of Kampot Provincial Administrative Unity Command on July 20, 2020 at the meeting hall of Kampot Provincial Hall, with the participation of municipal authorities, specialized departments and units of the Armed Forces and the Prosecution Court. Accompanying Kampot Provincial Court.
Chiao Tai provincial governor said that from day to day, problems always occur at the local level of each district, while some old problems are not yet resolved. And the problem is that a small number of officials do not seem to pay much attention to trying to solve problems related to their skills or problems in their jurisdiction, making local people dissatisfied and lack confidence in the actions of government officials. Government.
