The provincial governor also stressed that the provincial administration is also a representative of the Royal Government, and the municipal administration also represents the Royal Government, differing only in the appointment by Royal Decree and Sub-Decree, so the municipal administration must increase its sense of responsibility. Work in its locality, and in case of trying to solve, if there is no result, report to the provincial administration to help solve.
The provincial governor also reminded the meeting, stating that in response to the instructions of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, who always reminded the provincial and municipal administrations to pay attention. Strive to fulfill their duties and responsibilities as actively as possible.
