(Pursat): The Governor of Pursat Province, Mr. Mao Thunin, on July 20, 2020, paid a courtesy call on the people and business people who are looking to eat in Pursat Central Market after the 19-situation situation in Pursat. Cambodia seems a bit lighter.
Speaking on that occasion, Mr. Mao Thunin said that this is a habit that he used to visit regularly in all 11 markets throughout Pursat province to grasp the well-being of people as well as traders in all markets. The provincial governor added that in the situation of 19 global Kovid eruptions, the world missed a bit to meet the business people, but now the situation of Kovid is a little better than before, especially in Pursat province, there are no 19 Kovid cases yet.
