The provincial governor advised the traders to put up for sale according to the designated lines to maintain the beauty and order of the market and to avoid traffic jams, as well as to accept requests related to environmental and sanitation order for contractors, tax authorities and authorities. The city will respond and resolve immediately for the business community.
